# scripts/opcount: toktree scans and builds N bytes of the repository's
# own Ergo source on its stdin; the cost of one byte is the slope between
# the two sizes. The control is the hand Go program of the same layout
# (wf10 self-layout plan §2.3, SL1).
unit byte
sizes 4000000 32000000
input go cmd/ergo/testdata/toktree/gen {n}
args {input}
control cmd/ergo/testdata/toktree/control
